#ASSERT `s 1087(1) the registrar must not make the material available for public inspection` `s 1087(1)(a) the contents of any document sent to the registrar containing views expressed pursuant to section 56 (comments on proposal by company to use certain words or expressions in company name)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
