#ASSERT `s 1087(1) the registrar must not make the material available for public inspection` `s 1087(1)(ba(ii)) representations received by the registrar in response to a notice under any corresponding provision of regulations under section 1046 (overseas companies)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
