#ASSERT `s 1087(1) the registrar must not make the material available for public inspection` `s 1087(1)(bba(i)) any application or other document delivered to the registrar under regulations under section 468A (regulations protecting profit and loss accounts for certain companies)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
