#ASSERT `s 1087(1) the registrar must not make the material available for public inspection` `s 1087(1)(e(i)) any application or other document delivered to the registrar under regulations under section 1088 (regulations protecting material), other than information provided by virtue of section 1088(5)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
